<title>SPAIN: LWR issues 5-yr matador bond for 10 bln pta.</title>
<headline>LWR issues 5-yr matador bond for 10 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>LW Rentenbank issued a five-year matador bond for 10 billion pesetas with a 5.625 pct coupon and a price of 101.15, lead manager Argentaria Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Joint lead managers are UBS and Banco Santander de Negocios.</p>
<p>Argentaria added that total fees are at 1.625 pct, pay date February 13, and maturity is February 13 2002.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
